---
import HubCitableStats from '../hub/HubCitableStats.astro';
interface Props { data?: any }
const { data } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="mockup-metricas-marketing" set:html={`<section class="hero"><div class="wrap crumb"><b>Negocios</b> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Métricas de marketing</div><div class="wrap grid"><div class="copy"><span class="eyebrow">Performance · de la impresión a la caja</span><h1>No optimices clicks. Optimizá clientes rentables.</h1><p>Conectá CPM, CTR, conversión, cierre y margen para saber cuánto cuesta vender y si la campaña realmente deja plata.</p><div class="chips"><span>✓ Embudo completo</span><span>✓ ROAS de equilibrio</span><span>✓ LTV sobre CAC</span></div><div class="art"><div class="dash"><div class="dash-head"><b>Campaña · últimos 30 días</b><span>Rentable</span></div><div class="bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="dash-foot"><span>Inversión<b>$300.000</b></span><span>Ingresos<b id="art-income">$370.286</b></span></div></div><div class="float"><small id="art-label">CAC ESTIMADO</small><b id="art-value">$36.458</b><span id="art-copy">8,2 clientes nuevos</span></div></div></div>
<form class="calc" onsubmit="return false"><div class="calc-head"><div><h2>Leé la campaña completa</h2><p class="muted">Las cuatro vistas usan el mismo embudo.</p></div><span class="tag">Unit economics</span></div><div class="label">¿Qué querés averiguar?</div><div class="cases"><button type="button" class="case active" data-mode="funnel"><i>▽</i>Costo por cliente</button><button type="button" class="case" data-mode="roas"><i>↗</i>Rentabilidad y ROAS</button><button type="button" class="case" data-mode="ltv"><i>∞</i>Valor del cliente</button><button type="button" class="case" data-mode="tax"><i>％</i>Costo real de pauta</button></div><div class="label">Datos de tu negocio</div><div class="fields">
<div class="field common tax"><label>Presupuesto de pauta ($)</label><input id="budget" value="300000"></div><div class="field common"><label>CPM · costo por mil impresiones ($)</label><input id="cpm" value="3500"></div><div class="field common"><label>CTR · impresiones a click (%)</label><input id="ctr" value="1.2"></div><div class="field common"><label>Conversión de landing (%)</label><input id="leadRate" value="4"></div><div class="field common"><label>Cierre · lead a cliente (%)</label><input id="closeRate" value="20"></div><div class="field common"><label>Ticket promedio ($)</label><input id="ticket" value="45000"></div><div class="field common"><label>Margen bruto (%)</label><input id="margin" value="40"></div>
<div class="field ltv hide"><label>Compras por cliente al año</label><input id="purchases" value="3"></div><div class="field ltv hide"><label>Churn mensual (%)</label><input id="churn" value="5"></div>
<div class="field tax hide"><label>Condición fiscal</label><select id="taxStatus"><option value="mono">Monotributista</option><option value="ri">Responsable inscripto</option></select></div><div class="field tax hide"><label>Forma de pago</label><select id="payMethod"><option value="pesos">Tarjeta en pesos</option><option value="usd">Dólares propios</option></select></div><div class="field tax hide"><label>Percepción IIBB (%)</label><input id="iibb" value="3.5"></div></div>
<section class="result"><div class="result-top"><div><small id="result-label">CAC · COSTO POR CLIENTE</small><div class="value" id="result">$36.458</div></div><div class="badge"><small id="badge-label">Clientes nuevos</small><b id="badge">8,2</b></div></div><div class="stats"><span id="s1l">CPC<b id="s1">$292</b></span><span id="s2l">CPL<b id="s2">$7.292</b></span><span id="s3l">INGRESOS PRIMERA COMPRA<b id="s3">$370.286</b></span></div><button class="go" id="update" type="button">Actualizar métricas</button></section></form></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><header class="center"><span id="funnel-kicker">La cascada completa</span><h2 id="funnel-title">Dónde se pierde la audiencia</h2><p id="funnel-copy">Cada paso multiplica al anterior. Una mejora chica en dos tasas puede bajar mucho el CAC.</p></header><div class="funnel"><article class="step"><small id="f1l">IMPRESIONES</small><b id="f1">85.714</b><span id="f1s">CPM $3.500</span></article><article class="step"><small id="f2l">CLICKS</small><b id="f2">1.029</b><span id="f2s">CTR 1,2%</span></article><article class="step"><small id="f3l">LEADS</small><b id="f3">41,1</b><span id="f3s">Conversión 4%</span></article><article class="step"><small id="f4l">CLIENTES</small><b id="f4">8,2</b><span id="f4s">Cierre 20%</span></article></div></div></section>
<section class="break"><div class="wrap breakgrid"><article class="card"><h3 id="detail-title">Tu campaña, línea por línea</h3><div class="line"><span id="d1l">Inversión</span><b id="d1">$300.000</b></div><div class="line"><span id="d2l">Costo por click</span><b id="d2">$292</b></div><div class="line"><span id="d3l">Costo por lead</span><b id="d3">$7.292</b></div><div class="line"><span id="d4l">Clientes nuevos</span><b id="d4">8,2</b></div><div class="line total"><strong id="d5l">CAC pagado</strong><b id="d5">$36.458</b></div></article><article class="card"><h3>Antes de escalar presupuesto</h3><div class="rule"><i>1</i><div><b>Esperá suficiente volumen</b><span>Con pocas conversiones, una sola venta mueve todo el resultado.</span></div></div><div class="rule"><i>2</i><div><b>Usá una ventana coherente</b><span>La inversión y las ventas deben pertenecer al mismo ciclo.</span></div></div><div class="rule"><i>3</i><div><b>Sumá el costo completo</b><span>Equipo, agencia, herramientas y creatividad elevan el CAC contable.</span></div></div><div class="warning">La plataforma atribuye ventas, pero no prueba incrementalidad. Compará contra una base o grupo de control.</div></article></div></section>
<section class="metrics"><div class="wrap"><header class="center"><span>Una cuenta, cuatro decisiones</span><h2>Qué responde cada métrica</h2></header><div class="metricgrid"><article class="metric"><i>▽</i><h3>CAC</h3><p>Cuánto presupuesto pagado necesitás para sumar un cliente.</p><em>Adquisición</em></article><article class="metric"><i>↗</i><h3>ROAS</h3><p>Cuántos pesos de ingreso genera cada peso invertido.</p><em>No descuenta costos</em></article><article class="metric"><i>∞</i><h3>LTV</h3><p>Cuánto factura y cuánto margen deja un cliente mientras se queda.</p><em>Retención</em></article><article class="metric"><i>⏱</i><h3>Payback</h3><p>Cuántos meses tarda el cliente en devolver su CAC.</p><em>Caja y crecimiento</em></article></div></div></section>
<section class="darksec"><div class="wrap darkgrid"><div><span class="eyebrow" style="color:#9edbcf">Las referencias que importan</span><h2>Un ROAS alto puede perder plata.</h2><p>Todo depende del margen. Y un LTV prometedor no alcanza si tardás demasiado en recuperar el CAC.</p></div><div class="bench"><div><small>LTV / CAC SANO</small><b>≥ 3×</b><span>Usando margen</span></div><div><small>PAYBACK CAC</small><b>&lt; 12 meses</b><span>Mejor cuanto antes</span></div><div><small>ROAS EQUILIBRIO</small><b>1 ÷ margen</b><span>40% → 2,5×</span></div></div></div></section><div class="foot"></div>`} />
<script is:inline>
(()=>{const root=document.currentScript.previousElementSibling?.matches('.mockup-metricas-marketing')?document.currentScript.previousElementSibling:document.querySelector('.mockup-metricas-marketing');

const $=s=>root.querySelector(s),$$=s=>root.querySelectorAll(s),n=id=>Math.max(0,Number($(id).value)||0),ars=x=>"$"+Math.round(x||0).toLocaleString("es-AR"),f=(x,d=1)=>Number(x||0).toLocaleString("es-AR",{minimumFractionDigits:d,maximumFractionDigits:d});let mode="funnel";
function txt(id,v){$("#"+id).textContent=v}function stats(labels,vals){["s1l","s2l","s3l"].forEach((id,i)=>{$("#"+id).childNodes[0].nodeValue=labels[i];txt("s"+(i+1),vals[i])})}function details(title,rows){txt("detail-title",title);rows.forEach((r,i)=>{txt("d"+(i+1)+"l",r[0]);txt("d"+(i+1),r[1])})}function flow(labels,vals,subs,k,t,c){txt("funnel-kicker",k);txt("funnel-title",t);txt("funnel-copy",c);for(let i=1;i<=4;i++){txt("f"+i+"l",labels[i-1]);txt("f"+i,vals[i-1]);txt("f"+i+"s",subs[i-1])}}
function calc(){let budget=n("#budget"),cpm=n("#cpm"),ctr=n("#ctr")/100,leadRate=n("#leadRate")/100,close=n("#closeRate")/100,ticket=n("#ticket"),margin=Math.min(1,n("#margin")/100),impressions=cpm?budget/cpm*1000:0,clicks=impressions*ctr,leads=clicks*leadRate,clients=leads*close,cpc=clicks?budget/clicks:0,cpl=leads?budget/leads:0,cac=clients?budget/clients:0,income=clients*ticket;txt("art-income",ars(income));
if(mode==="funnel"){txt("result-label","CAC · COSTO POR CLIENTE");txt("result",ars(cac));txt("badge-label","Clientes nuevos");txt("badge",f(clients,1));stats(["CPC","CPL","INGRESOS PRIMERA COMPRA"],[ars(cpc),ars(cpl),ars(income)]);details("Tu campaña, línea por línea",[["Inversión",ars(budget)],["Costo por click",ars(cpc)],["Costo por lead",ars(cpl)],["Clientes nuevos",f(clients,1)],["CAC pagado",ars(cac)]]);flow(["IMPRESIONES","CLICKS","LEADS","CLIENTES"],[Math.round(impressions).toLocaleString("es-AR"),Math.round(clicks).toLocaleString("es-AR"),f(leads,1),f(clients,1)],["CPM "+ars(cpm),"CTR "+f(ctr*100,1)+"%","Conversión "+f(leadRate*100,1)+"%","Cierre "+f(close*100,0)+"%"],"La cascada completa","Dónde se pierde la audiencia","Cada paso multiplica al anterior. Una mejora chica en dos tasas puede bajar mucho el CAC.");txt("art-label","CAC ESTIMADO");txt("art-value",ars(cac));txt("art-copy",f(clients,1)+" clientes nuevos");return}
if(mode==="roas"){let roas=budget?income/budget:0,breakEven=margin?1/margin:0,gross=income*margin,profit=gross-budget;txt("result-label","ROAS DE LA CAMPAÑA");txt("result",f(roas,2)+"×");txt("badge-label",profit>=0?"Ganancia neta":"Pérdida neta");txt("badge",(profit>=0?"+":"-")+ars(Math.abs(profit)));stats(["ROAS DE EQUILIBRIO","MARGEN BRUTO","CAC"],[f(breakEven,2)+"×",ars(gross),ars(cac)]);details("Tu rentabilidad, línea por línea",[["Inversión",ars(budget)],["Ingresos atribuidos",ars(income)],["ROAS",f(roas,2)+"×"],["ROAS de equilibrio",f(breakEven,2)+"×"],[profit>=0?"Ganancia neta":"Pérdida neta",ars(Math.abs(profit))]]);flow(["INGRESOS","COSTO PRODUCTO","PAUTA","RESULTADO"],[ars(income),ars(income*(1-margin)),ars(budget),(profit>=0?"+":"-")+ars(Math.abs(profit))],["ROAS "+f(roas,2)+"×","Margen "+f(margin*100,0)+"%","Inversión neta",profit>=0?"Campaña rentable":"No cubre margen"],"La cuenta económica","Ingresos no son ganancia","Primero sale el costo del producto y después la inversión publicitaria.");return}
if(mode==="ltv"){let churn=Math.max(.001,n("#churn")/100),purchases=n("#purchases"),life=1/churn,purchasesLife=purchases/12*life,ltv=ticket*purchasesLife,ltvMargin=ltv*margin,ratio=cac?ltvMargin/cac:0,monthly=ticket*purchases/12*margin,payback=monthly?cac/monthly:0;txt("result-label","LTV A MARGEN POR CLIENTE");txt("result",ars(ltvMargin));txt("badge-label","Relación LTV / CAC");txt("badge",f(ratio,1)+"×");stats(["VIDA MEDIA","PAYBACK DEL CAC","COMPRAS DE VIDA"],[f(life,1)+" meses",f(payback,1)+" meses",f(purchasesLife,1)]);details("El valor de tu cliente",[["CAC",ars(cac)],["Vida media",f(life,1)+" meses"],["LTV en ingresos",ars(ltv)],["LTV a margen",ars(ltvMargin)],["Relación LTV/CAC",f(ratio,1)+"×"]]);flow(["CAC","LTV INGRESOS","LTV MARGEN","PAYBACK"],[ars(cac),ars(ltv),ars(ltvMargin),f(payback,1)+" meses"],["Adquisición","Facturación total","Lo que queda",payback<=12?"Dentro de referencia":"Demasiado lento"],"Unit economics","¿El cliente devuelve lo que costó?","La relación debe mirarse sobre margen y junto al tiempo de recupero.");return}
let status=$("#taxStatus").value,pay=$("#payMethod").value,iva=budget*.21,perception=pay==="pesos"?budget*.30:0,iibb=pay==="pesos"?budget*n("#iibb")/100:0,gross=budget+iva+perception+iibb,recover=(status==="ri"?iva:0)+perception+iibb,real=gross-recover,surcharge=budget?(real/budget-1)*100:0;txt("result-label","COSTO REAL DE LA PAUTA");txt("result",ars(real));txt("badge-label","Débito bruto");txt("badge",ars(gross));stats(["IVA 21%","PERCEPCIONES","RECARGO EFECTIVO"],[ars(iva),ars(perception+iibb),f(surcharge,1)+"%"]);details("Impuestos y percepciones",[["Pauta neta",ars(budget)],["IVA",ars(iva)],["Ganancias + IIBB",ars(perception+iibb)],["Recuperable",ars(recover)],["Costo real",ars(real)]]);flow(["PAUTA NETA","IVA","PERCEPCIONES","DÉBITO BRUTO"],[ars(budget),ars(iva),ars(perception+iibb),ars(gross)],["Factura plataforma",status==="ri"?"Crédito fiscal":"Costo","A cuenta","Tarjeta / cuenta"],"Pauta del exterior","Lo debitado no es siempre el costo","Separá impuestos definitivos de percepciones recuperables.");txt("art-label","COSTO REAL");txt("art-value",ars(real));txt("art-copy","débito bruto "+ars(gross))}
function setMode(m){mode=m;$$(".case").forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle("active",b.dataset.mode===m));$$(".field.common,.field.ltv,.field.tax").forEach(x=>{let show=x.classList.contains("common")&&m!=="tax"||x.classList.contains(m);x.classList.toggle("hide",!show)});calc()}
$$(".case").forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>setMode(b.dataset.mode));$$("input,select").forEach(i=>i.oninput=calc);$("#update").onclick=e=>{calc();e.currentTarget.textContent="✓ Métricas actualizadas";setTimeout(()=>e.currentTarget.textContent="Actualizar métricas",1200)};setMode("funnel");

})();
</script>
<style is:global>

.mockup-metricas-marketing *{box-sizing:border-box}.mockup-metricas-marketing{margin:0;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;color:#14243b;background:#fff}.mockup-metricas-marketing button,.mockup-metricas-marketing input,.mockup-metricas-marketing select{font:inherit}.mockup-metricas-marketing .wrap{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto}.mockup-metricas-marketing .top{height:82px;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e5e8;display:flex;align-items:center}.mockup-metricas-marketing .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.mockup-metricas-marketing .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:18px;font-weight:900}.mockup-metricas-marketing .logo{width:31px;height:31px;border-radius:8px;background:#183653;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:12px}.mockup-metricas-marketing .links,.mockup-metricas-marketing .tools{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:25px}.mockup-metricas-marketing .links span{font-size:12px;font-weight:750;color:#526276}.mockup-metricas-marketing .tools span{border:1px solid #dbe3e7;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 13px;font-size:11px}.mockup-metricas-marketing .tools .dark{background:#183653;color:#fff}
.mockup-metricas-marketing .hero{background:radial-gradient(circle at 15% 78%,#e2f6f1 0,transparent 26%),linear-gradient(135deg,#f8fafb,#f3faf8);padding:27px 0 64px}.mockup-metricas-marketing .crumb{font-size:11px;color:#748194;margin-bottom:34px}.mockup-metricas-marketing .crumb b,.mockup-metricas-marketing .eyebrow{color:#248576}.mockup-metricas-marketing .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.84fr 1.16fr;gap:48px;align-items:start}.mockup-metricas-marketing .copy{padding-top:6px}.mockup-metricas-marketing .eyebrow{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.15em;font-weight:900;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}.mockup-metricas-marketing .eyebrow:before{content:"";width:27px;border-top:2px solid}.mockup-metricas-marketing .copy h1{font-size:50px;line-height:1.03;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:17px 0}.mockup-metricas-marketing .copy>p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#5d6e82}.mockup-metricas-marketing .chips{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:21px}.mockup-metricas-marketing .chips span{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce5e2;border-radius:9px;padding:8px 10px;font-size:9px;color:#56677a}
.mockup-metricas-marketing .art{height:247px;position:relative;margin-top:22px}.mockup-metricas-marketing .dash{position:absolute;left:31px;top:25px;width:305px;height:184px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9e4e1;border-radius:15px;box-shadow:0 22px 42px #17385818;padding:19px}.mockup-metricas-marketing .dash-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.mockup-metricas-marketing .dash-head b{font-size:15px}.mockup-metricas-marketing .dash-head span{font-size:8px;background:#e5f5f0;color:#237463;border-radius:99px;padding:5px 7px}.mockup-metricas-marketing .bars{display:flex;align-items:end;gap:10px;height:94px;border-bottom:1px solid #e4eaea;margin-top:13px;padding:0 11px}.mockup-metricas-marketing .bars i{display:block;flex:1;border-radius:7px 7px 0 0;background:#6ea7d0}.mockup-metricas-marketing .bars i:nth-child(1){height:28%}.mockup-metricas-marketing .bars i:nth-child(2){height:48%}.mockup-metricas-marketing .bars i:nth-child(3){height:42%}.mockup-metricas-marketing .bars i:nth-child(4){height:74%;background:#248576}.mockup-metricas-marketing .bars i:nth-child(5){height:89%;background:#248576}.mockup-metricas-marketing .dash-foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:9px;font-size:8px;color:#728196}.mockup-metricas-marketing .dash-foot b{display:block;color:#17304b;font-size:12px}.mockup-metricas-marketing .float{position:absolute;right:0;bottom:0;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dbe4e1;border-radius:13px;padding:14px 17px;box-shadow:0 15px 31px #17385818}.mockup-metricas-marketing .float small{display:block;font-size:7px;color:#718397}.mockup-metricas-marketing .float b{display:block;color:#248576;font-size:20px;margin:4px 0}.mockup-metricas-marketing .float span{font-size:8px;color:#63768a}
.mockup-metricas-marketing .calc{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d8e3e0;border-radius:20px;padding:26px 28px;box-shadow:0 25px 58px #17385817}.mockup-metricas-marketing .calc-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}.mockup-metricas-marketing .calc h2{font-size:23px;margin:0 0 4px}.mockup-metricas-marketing .muted{font-size:10px;color:#687b8d;margin:0}.mockup-metricas-marketing .tag{background:#e6f5f0;color:#248576;border-radius:99px;padding:7px 10px;font-size:8px;font-weight:850;height:max-content}.mockup-metricas-marketing .label{font-size:9px;font-weight:900;margin:17px 0 8px}.mockup-metricas-marketing .cases{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:7px}.mockup-metricas-marketing .case{border:1px solid #dce5e2;background:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 4px;min-height:68px;font-size:8px;font-weight:800;color:#5b6c7e;cursor:pointer}.mockup-metricas-marketing .case i{display:block;font-style:normal;font-size:16px;margin-bottom:3px}.mockup-metricas-marketing .case.active{border:2px solid #32907e;background:#edf8f4;color:#216c5d}.mockup-metricas-marketing .fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px}.mockup-metricas-marketing .field{border:1px solid #dce5e2;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 11px}.mockup-metricas-marketing .field.hide{display:none}.mockup-metricas-marketing .field.wide{grid-column:span 2}.mockup-metricas-marketing .field label{display:block;font-size:8px;color:#68798b;margin-bottom:5px}.mockup-metricas-marketing .field input,.mockup-metricas-marketing .field select{width:100%;border:0;outline:0;background:none;font-size:13px;font-weight:750;color:#17304b}.mockup-metricas-marketing .result{background:#183653;color:#fff;border-radius:15px;padding:18px 20px;margin-top:12px}.mockup-metricas-marketing .result-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px}.mockup-metricas-marketing .result small{font-size:8px;color:#b9cad6}.mockup-metricas-marketing .value{font-size:33px;letter-spacing:-.04em;font-weight